OL,3,GNEWSACould you live under deep-sea
OL,4,Apressure for 28 days?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deep sea divers of the future will
OL,7,Fsoon begin training in a former quarry
OL,8,Flake following a successful trial.
OL,10,FTaking place at DEEP's saturation
OL,11,Fimmersion diving facility in Tidenham,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, divers will live and
OL,13,Fwork in pressurised chambers that
OL,14,Freplicate being 50m (164ft) underwater
OL,15,Ffor up to a month.
OL,17,FDuring that time the divers will plunge
OL,18,Fbelow the surface in a separate diving
OL,19,Fbell chamber for tasks such as
OL,20,Finspecting pipes and welding, before
OL,21,Fslowly returning their bodies to normal
OL,22,Fsurface pressure.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
