OL,3,GNEWSACould you live under deep-sea
OL,4,Apressure for 28 days?
OL,5,
OL,6,FDEEP dive manager Mark Hamilton said
OL,7,Fthe company would now begin training
OL,8,Fthe "next generation of saturation
OL,9,Fdivers", which the industry
OL,10,F"desperately needs".
